      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "For the high-stakes dietary needs, the absolute must-do is to implement a strict, color-coded system for all food preparation, ensuring that nut-free and vegan stations are entirely segregated. You can manage the kitchen chaos by creating a detailed, visual checklist for every single dish, which should be reviewed by a designated \"Safety Captain\" before any service begins. This level of meticulousness, while seeming like a lot of work now, will prevent the small, irritating mishaps from escalating into a real disaster. Trusting a single person to manage everything is a recipe for chaos, so delegate clearly.",
      "source": "target",
